@startuml

[*] --> Powering_On : Power-On
Powering_On --> Startup_Check : Startup Complete (No Problems)
Startup_Check --> Ready_To_Use : Startup Complete (No Problems)
Ready_To_Use --> Monitoring : Activation Requested by User
Monitoring --> Alarm_Activated : Sensor Triggered
Alarm_Activated --> Monitoring : False Alarm Confirmed or Time Ends
Monitoring, Alarm_Activated, Ready_To_Use --> Normal : Password Entered
Normal --> [*] : Any Event

@enduml
